Thanks to all who responded:

	Phil Farrell
	Sean O'Connell
	Thomas Erskine
	Richard Eisenman
	Kevin Oberman	
	Paul A Sand	
	SIMEONE, Allan J.
	Robert L. McMillin
	Carlos A M dos Santos
	David Bremer	
	Peter Stern
	eli_elizur
	Robert Schuhl	
	John T.	
	Ollivier Robert

About half of thoses who responded suggest that I use tcsh instead of csh.
Using the suggestions of other respondants, I have found that using

set term=vt100
set editmode=emacs
set history=100

in the .cshrc fixes the problem with command recall.  Also, filename 
completion can be turned on by

set filec


