Since you didn't say which version of Digital UNIX you are running, I
will give you the generic answer:

	Look in the SPD and in the Digital Systems and Options Catalog.

You can find the Systems and Options Catalog in the www.digital.com web
site under products.  You can find the SPD in your Digital UNIX kit or
